# dock: the tiles down the right edge, docs/CHROME.md section 12. A tile
# names its program, which is its icon and the `app` its windows say, and
# what a click runs when none is up. $home/lib/wb/dock is read after this.
tile  rc      window rc -i
tile  prefs   prefs
tile  mothra  window mothra
clock                          # the time, in the readout face
load                           # the memory in use, as a column of LEDs
